lient and try launching it again. This update does not add new features or change the behavior of the Windo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T10:19:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262688610","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4629450-1842212951300633","game_id":"steam-4629450","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: MIDI Tempo Map, A-B Repeat, and ASIO Support","summary":"This update improves MIDI playback, focused repetition, and audio input on Windows, along with several Training Mode and usability improvements. MIDI Tempo Map SupportGuitar Practice Mate can now follow tempo change events embedded in MIDI files.Turn MIDI Tempo Map playback on or offUse the tempo slider as a playback-speed multiplierDisplay tempo changes on the scoreContinue using the previous fixed-tempo playback modeA-B Section RepeatYou can now select start and end positions on the score and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T16:17:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951300633","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4629450-1839041357028882","game_id":"steam-4629450","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v1.0.2","summary":"The demo has been updated to v1.0.2This update introduces several features designed to make your practice sessions easier to start and more useful to review.Practice HistoryYou can now review your previous practice sessions and performance results.Check your accuracy, judgment results, personal bests, and changes in your performance over time.Quick StartA new Quick Start guide has been added for first-time users. It explains the basic controls and how to begin a practice session.You can open the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T08:28:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357028882","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4629450-1836506165565871","game_id":"steam-4629450","kind":"announcement","title":"Try Training Mode in the Free Demo","summary":"We’ve unlocked Training Mode for the demo track in the trial version! Please give it a try and share your feedback with us.Update DetailsTraining Mode is now available in the trial version for the 10 phrases included in the demo track “Track:00.Demo”.Please note that Training Mode is not available for MIDI files imported into the custom folder.Important Notes on Training ModeTraining Mode is recommended for line input using an ASIO device.To ensure accurate training evaluation, proper latency co","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T16:09:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165565871","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4629450-1833968530888857","game_id":"steam-4629450","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO OUT NOW","summary":"We've released a demo version!Please give it a try and let us know what you think!Utilize available features・Display and playback of demo song sheet music・Importing custom MIDI files・Tuner functionOther Restrictions・The characters are fixed and cannot be changed.・Character voices are not included.・Character animations are fixed.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T17:02:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530888857","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:17Z","discovery_method":"of